; One executable per day. The (modules ...) field stops being optional as soon
; as there is a second stanza: without it each one claims every module in this
; directory, and dune rejects a module claimed by more than one. It is written
; out from the first stanza so that adding the second is a copy rather than a
; correction.

(executable
 (name y2025d01)
 (modules y2025d01))
